    "review_summary": "Accuracy: UniProt no longer serves this rule; rest.uniprot.org/arba/ARBA00089395 returned \"Resource not found\" on 2026-11-09, so its annotation cannot be re-examined. For the record, the two recorded conditions match 10 Swiss-Prot entries, all S. pombe major facilitator transporters, and only one of them (Q7Z9I0) carries GO:1903710 (spermine transmembrane transport). Meaning and parsimony: not assessed. The rule is withdrawn, and its consequent is known only from the earlier analysis. The one recorded set would have put a single-substrate transport term on ten S. pombe transporters of which one is annotated to it, which is weak ground for a judgement of the unit and was not pursued.",
